77, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ik1.jpg"}], "slug": "basement-to-the-sky", "storyline": "Today is your birthday. Warm sunshine, perfect weather. Your parents are away for work, but they\u2019ve left you a birthday gift \u2014 a rocket. Build your own rocket and launch it high into the sky. Cook delicious meals to fill your stomach, and earn money through part-time jobs to upgrade your rocket. Little by little, higher and farther. How far can your rocket go? Spend a special day that feels like stepping back into your childhood.", "summary": "Basement to the Sky is a nostalgic rocket-crafting life simulation that takes you back to the golden days of childhood. Step into the shoes of your younger self: build and launch rockets, earn money by helping with chores, and cook your own delicious meals. Experiment with various parts to soar higher than ever before. Can your rocket truly reach the vastness of outer space? Embark on a journey where a child's dream meets the stars.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/basement-to-the-sky", "videos": [{"id": 177992, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "wWe-jqG2VKQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wWe-jqG2VKQ", "title": "Basement to the Sky - Demo Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wWe-jqG2VKQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}